{
  "_about": "Design tokens for SophieQuant. Dark, data-dense desktop theme. Roles only. Paleta 'Noche Violeta' fijada por replica-brand: familia violeta (#9d7bff), deliberadamente alejada de la firma de la original (naranja #fe8f3a + azul #52b2ff). Check with: python3 contrast.py tokens.json",
